[{"title":"元夕赐午门观灯 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"鳌山高耸架层空，万烛烧春瑞气融。\n星动银河浮菡萏，天垂琼岛绽芙蓉。\n行行綵队穿华月，曲曲鸾笙度好风。\n自是太平多乐事，君王要与万方同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14042,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕赐午门观灯 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"凤辇初临鼓吹喧，千官环侍紫宸边。\n九门灯火云霄上，午夜山河锦绣前。\n春散炉烟浮树暖，月移宝仗映花妍。\n从臣忝预传柑宴，既醉犹歌《湛露》篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14043,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕赐午门观灯 其三","author":"金幼孜","text":"天上红云湿翠旗，楼前灯影动罘罳。\n御筵花煖歌声近，紫禁风清玉漏迟。\n中使传宣还赐果，词臣献赋更陈诗。\n华夷尽道承恩泽，千载昌期际此时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14044,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕午门赐观灯 其二","author":"金幼孜","text":"天仗森森列宝台，教坊初进鼓如雷。\n金莲夜放轻寒散，绛蜡春融瑞气回。\n仙乐慢调双玉管，紫宸频上万年杯。\n传柑岁岁承恩渥，感遇深惭负不才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14045,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕午门观灯应制 其十二","author":"金幼孜","text":"阊阖重重夜不扃，琼楼十二敞银屏。\n东风一曲升平乐，此夜都人尽许听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14046,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月十日随驾猎海子上奉简胡学士杨庶子","author":"金幼孜","text":"暖日融融静鼓鼙，条风拂拂动旌旗。\n柳间饮马春泉细，花里闻莺昼漏迟。\n近苑猎回犹赐馔，行宫朝罢更题诗。\n晚来独向都城望，云拥蓬莱五色垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14047,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扈从狩阳山次韵答胡学士","author":"金幼孜","text":"鸾舆晓出五城东，从狩儒臣载笔同。\n日下苍龙随玉仗，道前宝马载雕弓。\n苑松承露枝皆白，岛树经霜叶尽红。\n向晚笳声催叠鼓，军门校猎气偏雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扈从再狩武冈次学士胡公韵 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"晓瞻行殿倚岧峣，步入高峰路更遥。\n铁骑蹴云开御道，苍鹰掠野上层霄。\n旌旄高下随山转，烟火依微隔树烧。\n忝后词臣惭谫薄，几回扈跸逐行镳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北京八景 其六 西山霁雪","author":"金幼孜","text":"海上云收旭景新，连峰积雪净如银。\n晴光迥入千门晓，淑气先回上谷春。\n瑶树生辉寒已散，琼林消冻煖偏匀。\n玉堂相对题诗好，移席钩帘坐夕曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北京八景 其一 居庸叠翠","author":"金幼孜","text":"巀嵲天关复几重，龙飞凤翥势偏雄。\n千山黛色落平野，万里烟光明远空。\n峡口人行春雨外，树边鸟度夕阳中。\n北巡记得随鸾驭，曾上云间第一峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北京八景 其五 蓟门烟树","author":"金幼孜","text":"平野荒荒接蓟门，淡烟疏树碧絪缊。\n过桥酒幔依稀见，附郭人家远近分。\n翠羽落花行处有，绿阴啼鸟坐来闻。\n玉京尽日多佳气，缥缈还看映五云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云山草堂为杨庶子赋 其一","author":"金幼孜","text":"闻道幽居近翠微，好山多与白云齐。\n柳塘日煖花争发，门巷春深鸟自啼。\n酒醒每临松下坐，诗成閒向竹边题。\n一从射策金门去，风雨年年梦建溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗九首 其五","author":"黄淮","text":"蒿蓬相因依，飘飘逐风起。\n风力有时息，零落在泥滓。\n兰蕙幽且清，扬辉被芳沚。\n白露凝为霜，华叶亦披靡。\n蒿蓬何足叹，嘅此蕙与兰。\n兰衰有馀馥，犹足奉君欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋暮书怀","author":"黄淮","text":"极目关山几夕阳，况逢秋暮转凄凉。\n愁思竹叶浮鹦鹉，寒觅芦花当鹔鹴。\n报主志存龟左顾，思亲心逐雁南翔。\n折筳拟卜馀生事，只恐灵氛也断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌栖曲 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"阶前候虫鸣唧唧，机上美人不成织。\n含情下阶望天河，鹊桥横练正无波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌栖曲 其四","author":"胡俨","text":"夜半乌啼月将落，金缸青荧照罗幕。\n抱琴试鼓《白头吟》，凄凄切切难为心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"荷叶高低笼水碧，叶下花红露沾湿，采莲渡头风正急。\n风正急，棹船归，云片片，雨霏霏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"湖中花艳张红云，湖上女儿新茜裙，清歌妙曲隔花闻。\n隔花闻，声宛转，迹虽亲，心独远。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其三","author":"胡俨","text":"采得荷花香满衣，与郎相见思依依，晚凉湖上并船归。\n并船归，桂为楫，激清波，荡明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"春风吹帘斜，帘开飞柳花。\n美人高堂上，见此惜年华。\n年华容易随春草，一双蛾眉镜中老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14061,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"碧水泛回塘，新荷艳晓妆。\n看花临绮槛，爱此双鸳鸯。\n鸳鸯宛转回塘路，相对朝朝还暮暮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14062,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其三","author":"胡俨","text":"秋露白如玉，梧桐坠寒绿。\n文犀镇锦帐，红泪销银烛。\n银烛轻摇翡翠烟，孤影荧荧夜不眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14063,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其四","author":"胡俨","text":"叶落深闺静，露零宵鹤警。\n玉井冻无声，梦回寒夜永。\n夜永铜龙漏幽咽，小窗斜转梅花月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远将归","author":"胡俨","text":"去年与郎别，杨花飞白雪。\n今年候郎归，杨柳绿依依。\n闻郎买船下湘渚，日日门前望行旅。\n行人过尽乳鸦啼，徘徊日暮空延伫。\n揽衣回洞房，对镜下新妆。\n那知清漏短，但爱明月光。\n月光照席凉于水，帐里灯花撒红蕊。\n好事从来不浪传，明日升堂报姑喜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"湖上闻郎歌《竹枝》，湖中莲艇便轻移。\n却言郎度潇湘去，折得荷花空泪垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"闻郎昨夜下巴东，烟树苍苍山万重。\n一片阳云飞不定，不知何处有郎踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其三","author":"胡俨","text":"船头烟暝浪花飞，船里风来雨湿衣。\n独棹兰桡下莲渚，迎郎不见又空归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其四","author":"胡俨","text":"荷叶亭亭秋色阑，露珠风荡不成团。\n自怜颜色非前日，羞把新妆临水看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"罨画楼前雨歇时。\n千丝万缕绿垂垂。\n无端却被风吹起，撩乱春心不自持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"罩水和烟万叶重。\n倚风飞絮晓茸茸。\n莫教吹落长河去，化作浮萍无定踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其三","author":"胡俨","text":"门外春风杨柳枝。\n去年折柳送郎时。\n车轮一去无消息，只有长条依旧垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝词 其四","author":"胡俨","text":"画帘风动影丝丝。\n曳绿摇金昼景迟。\n睡起倚阑看蛱蝶，莺声只在最高枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调笑词 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"明月。\n明月。\n今古几回圆缺。\n天风吹上云端。\n琼楼玉宇露寒。\n寒露。\n寒露。\n捣药谁怜顾兔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调笑词 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"绿绮。\n绿绮。\n写得高山流水。\n海天烟雾漫漫。\n明月松风夜寒。\n寒夜。\n寒夜。\n鹤舞银河初下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调笑词 其四","author":"胡俨","text":"泥滑。\n泥滑。\n道上间关车辖。\n凄凄切切低飞。\n正是行人远归。\n归远。\n归远。\n只恐山头日晚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟饮酒效陶渊明十首 其六","author":"胡俨","text":"凯风自南来，飒然入吾庐。\n翻翻动书帙，素琴聊自娱。\n好鸟鸣前楹，竹树交扶疏。\n北窗适闲旷，美酒湛清壶。\n南山天际明，浮云空翳如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟饮酒效陶渊明十首 其三","author":"胡俨","text":"几日不饮酒，饮酒辄开颜。\n村墟寡轮鞅，柴门昼常关。\n幽兰吐疏花，荣荣生竹间。\n白云何处来，日暮宿檐端。\n流盼不觉暝，明月出东山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14078,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟饮酒效陶渊明十首 其八","author":"胡俨","text":"朔风何烈烈，场圃已新筑。\n相与纳禾稼，壶浆辄往复。\n尽醉舒襟颜，形迹谢拘束。\n鸡犬鸣深巷，牛羊散平陆。\n老稚杂笑谈，和乐知岁足。\n盘飧与粔籹，墟曲走童仆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14079,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居秋兴 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"闲居南郭外，水竹清且幽。\n芳草被曲径，远树浮沧洲。\n出门临方沼，欣然见鱼游。\n宾客时一至，燕谈叙绸缪。\n开樽共斟酌，真率无献酬。\n日暮各自归，新月上林丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14080,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居秋兴二首 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"草虫阶下鸣，夜久犹未歇。\n掩卷坐阒寥，秋声振林樾。\n人生知几何，忧来不可辍。\n风吹浮云开，送我半窗月。\n逍遥步前庭，孤萤自明灭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14081,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅杨少傅四首 其三","author":"胡俨","text":"囊中孤桐琴，负疴久不弹。\n玉轸映金徽，徒縆朱丝弦。\n成连去不返，烟雾迷海山。\n山水久寂寞，谅彼知音难。\n《阳春》固寡和，《别鹤》亦辛酸。\n迢迢牵牛星，相望一水间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14082,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"骤雨戏作","author":"胡俨","text":"飑风吹回雨如织，黑云压空电飞急。\n青山隔江烟雾深，野水弥漫新涨入。\n老龙身疲鳞甲稀，变形潜蛰枯树枝。\n天书夜下霹雳追，老龙走出树辄披。\n劈空拿云卷江水，陇亩茫茫波浪起。\n天公为民驱老龙，老龙虽苦田家喜。\n龙兮龙兮，尔劳慎勿辞。\n岁丰民足，尔乃无事游天池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14083,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"锦鸡图","author":"胡俨","text":"昔闻楚人不识凤，忽见山鸡重购之。\n我今画图写生态，羽毛五色光陆离。\n扶桑天鸡啼一声，阳乌散彩天下晴。\n此时山鸡亦出谷，喔喔飞来耀林麓。\n千岩万壑含东风，杏花吹香春雪红。\n顾影徘徊自爱惜，扬翘耸翅纷蒙茸。\n竹上花间日正高，向阳吐绶垂花绦。\n吴绫蜀锦织不得，戴胜偷眼惊伯劳。\n切莫临溪照碧流，对镜逢人舞便休。\n舞多目眩终颠仆，世人空诧韦公赋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14084,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孔雀图","author":"胡俨","text":"有鸟有鸟名孔雀，文彩光华动挥霍。\n修颈昂昂翠羽翘，大尾斑斑金错落。\n由来丽质产南方，丹山碧水多翱翔。\n芭蕉花开风正软，桄榔叶暗日初长。\n忽闻都护啼一声，山中百禽皆不鸣。\n松篁引韵笙竽奏，顾影徘徊舞翅轻。\n炎荒暑热时多雨，尾重低垂飞不举。\n一朝笼养近帘帏，可怜犹妒美人衣。\n永嘉谢环善写生，画图貌得边鸾清。\n老眼摩挲石苔紫，浑似枇杷树底行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14085,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"海棠睡足东风晓，金垆香烬余烟袅。\n游子伤春未得归，迢迢绿遍天涯草。\n锦屏围暖树交花，清露流珠湿绛霞。\n窗前有梦随蝴蝶，门外无人啼乳鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14086,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"绿阴门巷垂青子，庭院深沉双燕语。\n金缕莺穿杨柳风，白头人卧芭蕉雨。\n林中新笋已交加，犹自阶前有落花。\n长卿多病心如雪，闲却平生书五车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14087,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其三","author":"胡俨","text":"银河星淡流云湿，苍苔露滴莎鸡泣。\n久客萧条未授衣，谁家捣练声声急。\n嘹呖惊闻过雁低，更堪乌鹊又争栖。\n援琴欲鼓清商调，月冷风凄意转迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14088,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时词 其四","author":"胡俨","text":"开遍梅花雪初落，深寒尚觉貂裘薄。\n纸帐偏宜白发酣，茶瓯却被青娥谑。\n闲来索笑对汤婆，枕席相从年颇多。\n莫怪老夫今冷落，故衾犹是赐兜罗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14089,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续十二辰诗","author":"胡俨","text":"鼹鼠饮河河不干，牛女长年相见难。\n赤手南山缚猛虎，月中取兔天漫漫。\n骊龙有珠常不睡，画蛇添足适为累。\n老马何曾有角生，羝羊触藩徒忿懥。\n莫笑楚人冠沐猴，祝鸡空自老林丘。\n舞阳屠狗沛中市，平津牧豕海东头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14090,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵胡学士春日陪驾游万岁山十首 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"凤辇宸游日，祥云夹道红。\n香风传别殿，飞翠绕行宫。\n径转千岩合，波回一镜空。\n忽看鸾鹤起，声在半天中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14091,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵胡学士春日陪驾游万岁山十首 其六","author":"胡俨","text":"阁道云为幄，仙山玉作台。\n更无凡迹到，只有异香来。\n柳拂金舆度，花迎宝扇开。\n太平多乐事，扈从得徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14092,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"久雨喜晴明日立夏","author":"胡俨","text":"一月厌雨声，忽逢今日晴。\n春从花上去，风过竹间清。\n睡美新茶熟，身闲野服轻。\n近来多坦率，客至倦逢迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14093,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春兴四首 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"门外草萋萋，东西路欲迷。\n莺捎穿树蝶，燕拾落花泥。\n深翠笼长薄，流云度碧溪。\n独携筇竹杖，不觉过桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14094,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日从驾幸南郊梁赞善以诗柬寄因和之","author":"胡俨","text":"紫陌鸡鸣远报晨，百官朝罢出枫宸。\n龙旗夹道先传警，凤辇行春不动尘。\n礼乐幸逢全盛日，耕桑俱是太平人。\n千门万户东风暖，胜里金花剪彩新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14095,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆昔四首寄士奇勉仁二少傅幼孜少保 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"昔者承恩共拜官，两班分日直金銮。\n晚来归舍星同戴，晓起趋朝漏未残。\n墨点龙笺濡彩笔，烛传庭燎捧金盘。\n如今忆着当时事，独望桥山泪不干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14096,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三台词 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"一阵霜风乍起，半窗月影初斜。\n宝匣烧残香篆，银釭落尽灯花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14097,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三台词 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"坐稳锦茵重迭，醉来乌帽欹斜。\n谁遣青娥斗月，自怜银海生花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14098,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三台词 其三","author":"胡俨","text":"楼上角声呜咽，天边斗柄横斜。\n酒醒风惊帘幕，漏残月在梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14099,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永乐八年春二月被诏直内阁即事二首 其一","author":"胡俨","text":"清晓朝回秘阁中，坐看宫树露华浓。\n绿窗朱户图书满，人在蓬莱第一峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14100,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永乐八年春二月被诏直内阁即事二首 其二","author":"胡俨","text":"浩荡东风雨散丝，暗移春色上花枝。\n云阴半卷龙楼晚，正是词臣退直时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14101,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鸣鸠拂羽图","author":"胡俨","text":"日暖风喧泪竹斑，鸣鸠拂羽树林间。\n眼中正是春光好，唤雨呼晴莫等闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14102,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题师侍郎画四首 其三","author":"胡俨","text":"遥看瀑布落寒青，野服乌巾自在行。\n好似匡庐读书处，满林红叶夜猿声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14103,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述怀（二十年作） 其一","author":"王汝玉","text":"蚤年蔑知识，负志颇傲岸。\n每鄙子张辟，常嫌仲由谚。\n浩气逸虹蜺，高情薄霄汉。\n悬河吐狂谈，振绮洒芳翰。\n辞胎珠晶荧，出璞玉璀璨。\n群英见推奖，前辈辱称赞。\n问齿方在童，有发犹未冠。\n展转时物非，蹉跎岁华换。\n风霜忽凄厉，雨雪亦零乱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14104,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述怀","author":"王汝玉","text":"蚤年蔑知识，负志颇傲岸。\n每鄙子张辟，常嫌仲由谚。\n浩气逸虹蜺，高情薄霄汉。\n悬河吐狂谈，振绮洒芳翰。\n辞胎珠晶荧，出璞玉璀璨。\n群英见推奖，前辈辱称赞。\n问齿方在童，有发犹未冠。\n展转时物非，蹉跎岁华换。\n风霜忽凄厉，雨雪亦零乱。\n未纵跃川鳞，早铩凌云翰。\n顾瞻乏良图，进退昧深算。\n豺狼正纵横，虎豹共奔窜。\n一身甘贱贫，十口寄丛灌。\n蒸藜当晨炊，扫叶供午爨。\n角巾不裹头，破褐仅遮骭。\n世途日孔棘，家道屡多难。\n百忧遂纷纭，万事总芜漫。\n浮踪学萍漂，浪迹类梗断。\n徒怀济时略，独抱穷途叹。\n携书过海滨，负笈客江畔。\n感至恒支颐，愁来频扼腕。\n今秋看又残，兹夕坐将半。\n哀哀鹊绕枝，嗷嗷鸿失伴。\n青灯乍明灭，皎月方辉焕。\n寒声撼空窗，露气逼虚幔。\n壮怀凝欲消，归思浩莫绊。\n惊鱼怯举网，伤鸟畏张弹。\n未睹黄河清，空歌白石烂。\n乱杵递相催，群鸡互争唤。\n出门望东方，漫漫何时旦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":14105,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]